    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_PHOTO_001",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "照片有一角被压折了。树下的女孩眯着眼，像是嫌太阳太晒。年轻的周叙站在她旁边，没有看镜头。照片里还拍进了一截别人的书包。",
      "backText": "2009.6，南门那棵树。\n周叙拍照的时候能不能看镜头。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_OLD_PHOTO"
      ],
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_LETTER_001",
      "type": "letter",
      "actionText": "查看信封",
      "text": "信封正面写着“周叙 收”。右下角是三个字：许知夏。\n\n背面没有地址。开口处留着一小段胶的痕迹，像是曾经贴住，又揭开了。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_LETTER"
      ],
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_TICKET",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "车票上还能看出“17路”。下面的日期很模糊，最后一个数字分不清是六还是八。\n\n周叙记得那时坐车要准备零钱。有几次没带够，司机让他到下一站换开。他以前一直以为这些票早就扔了。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_BUS_TICKET"
      ],
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_ROPE",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "蓝色线几乎褪成灰色。打结的地方缠着一根短头发，周叙没有去扯。\n\n他试着把那个结拆开。拉了两下，越拉越紧，只好放回原处。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_OLD_ROPE"
      ],
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_MP3_001",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "屏幕全黑。电源键得用指甲才能按下去，按了很久也没反应。充电口里有点灰。\n\n他把绕在上面的线解下来，才发现并不是充电线，只是一副坏了的耳机。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "FOUND_MP3"
      ],
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_NAME_001",
      "type": "passage",
      "title": "那个名字",
      "category": "main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "程安然看见了信封上的名字，伸手把旁边那杯水挪远。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "ANRAN",
          "text": "认识？"
        },
        {
          "text": "周叙拿着信封，没有马上回答。厨房里的锅盖响了一下，她回头看了一眼，又转回来等他。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C002",
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_C002",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": "要怎么向程安然说起许知夏？",
      "consequence": "影响他是否向妻子坦白过去，并由深夜的对白承接。",
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "高中同学。",
          "effects": {
            "avoidance": 1
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "ANSWERED_CLASSMATE"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP02_A001"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "以前喜欢过的人。",
          "effects": {
            "honesty": 2,
            "understandingPartner": 1
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "TOLD_PARTNER_XIA"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP02_B001"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "以前很熟的朋友。",
          "effects": {
            "avoidance": 1
          },
          "setFlags": [
